 all to your customers. A first-person sawmill tycoon where you do the work yourself: take on commissions, hire a crew, replant the forest and grow a humble yard into a timber empire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Hungarian, Slovak", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010520/36af668a026c780242bf397874e00d4b78e17a94/header.jpg?t=1788356450", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010520/524453928270588590b0e068d19328e24f11d008/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788356450", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5010520/524453928270588590b0e068d19328e24f11d008/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788356450", "website": "https://mgdbstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (version 21H1 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Single-player. Internet connection optional (Twitch and Kick chat integration only).</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro